  "question": {
    "text": "If the equation of the parabola with vertex $\\mathrm{V}\\left(\\frac{3}{2}, 3\\right)$ and the directrix $x+2 y=0$ is $\\alpha x^2+\\beta y^2-\\gamma x y-30 x-60 y+225=0$, then $\\alpha+\\beta+\\gamma$ is equal to :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "fRNTG",
      "text": "7",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "MJpF2",
      "text": "9",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "yohaP",
